cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, please cite the manuscript below."
title: "Barrios Visibles: analysis code and manuscript source"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code and manuscript source for Barrios Visibles, which compares
  RENABAP's enumeration of Argentina's informal settlements against 1.97
  million building footprints from the combined Google, Microsoft, and
  OpenStreetMap dataset.
type: software
